{
  "bodyHash": "+ufslSp1L6U=",
  "content": "<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/banner.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p><p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-gateways\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=00AF5C\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-gateways\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=F16436\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=5865F2\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveGateways\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Github\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;color=181717\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fimmersive-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"通过 Crowdin 翻译\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Crowdin-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=crowdin&amp;color=2E3340\">\n</a>\n</p><p>\n沉浸式传送门为 Minecraft 主世界引入了神秘且被遗忘已久的传送门结构。这些传送门既无法合成也无法移动，必须通过探索发现，并鼓励玩家发展世界。每个传送门都连接到世界上的某个地方，可实现快速旅行，同时不会贬低其他交通方式的价值。传送门有动画效果，兼具沉浸式氛围，设计上仿佛它们本就存在于你的世界中。\n</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/screenshots/screen1.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p><p>\n该模组新增了25种独特的传送门结构，自然生成于世界各地。传送门根据生物群系特定生成，自然地融入环境。没有 GUI，没有科技树，只有一种沉浸式的方式来以非线性方式探索你的世界。\n</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/screenshots/screen7.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p><p>\n早在玩家建造黑曜石框架之前，远古的建筑者就已用如今失传的知识塑造了世界。这些传送门是那个时代的遗迹，是连接遥远土地的锚点。时间掩埋了它们，风化石柱，将它们的用途从记忆中抹去。然而魔法依然萦绕，等待着足够好奇的旅人踏入，重新连接旧世界的路径。\n</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/screenshots/screen6.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p><p>\n未来的更新将涵盖更多生物群系、地下世界，当然还有下界。传送门将始终保持不可合成，但创造传送门的工具将在创造模式菜单中完善并公开，供地图制作者使用，模组包作者也可以选择在生存模式中整合它们。\n</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/screenshots/screen3.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p><h1>沉浸式系列</h1><p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-armors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式盔甲&amp;description=大量独特且忠于原版的盔甲套装。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式盔甲\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式飞机&amp;description=一系列用于旅行、运输和探索的质朴飞机！&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式飞机\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-melodies\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式旋律&amp;description=在各种乐器上演奏自定义旋律，骚扰你的朋友！&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式旋律\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式画作&amp;description=拖拽放置、像素化并挂起美丽的艺术品。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式画作\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-optimization\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式优化&amp;description=一个轻量级实体刻调度器，使 TPS 翻倍。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式优化\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selectivebounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=选择性边框&amp;description=在不相关时隐藏难看的方块选择轮廓。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/selectivebounds/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"选择性边框\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/man-of-many-planes\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=多人之翼&amp;description=为沉浸式飞机增加的一系列额外飞机，支持机械动力。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/man-of-many-planes/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"多人之翼\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-machinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式机械&amp;description=一系列用于运输、采矿和自动化的质朴机械。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式机械\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-furniture\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式家具&amp;description=在游戏中打造自定义且华丽的家具，或从庞大的在线库中选择。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-furniture/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式家具\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-gateways\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式传送门&amp;description=散落在主世界各处、被遗忘已久的传送门。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式传送门\">\n</a></p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/screenshots/screen4.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/pixel.png?immersive_pages_hash=3bb34e99e43a62935de6ee27c8ea9dab\" alt=\"用于简化页面部署的页面哈希值。\"></p>",
